Complete Learning Order
Read INI file (read)
List sections (sections)
Check section (has_section)
Check key (has_option)
Read value (get)
Add section (add_section)
Add/Update value (set)
Remove key (remove_option)
Remove section (remove_section)
Save changes (write)

These 10 programs cover nearly all day-to-day configparser usage for DevOps, Linux administration, and automation scripts.
